WEBVTT

00:03:56.840 --> 00:04:01.310
about futuristic girls that risk
everything to save plants

00:04:01.334 --> 00:04:03.563
or to race camels

00:04:03.587 --> 00:04:06.027
or even just to dance,

00:04:06.051 --> 00:04:07.772
to honor fun,

00:04:07.796 --> 00:04:09.919
because my world is mostly happy.

00:04:09.943 --> 00:04:13.713
And I know happiness is a privilege
in this current splintered world

00:04:13.737 --> 00:04:17.491
where remaining hopeful
requires diligence.

00:04:19.285 --> 00:04:24.628
But maybe, if you join me
in creating, curating and commissioning

00:04:24.652 --> 00:04:26.681
more AfroBubbleGum art,

00:04:26.705 --> 00:04:29.483
there might be hope
for a different view of the world,

00:04:29.507 --> 00:04:31.663
a happy Africa view